      "dc:source": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/sources/1037/",
      "target": {
        "source": {
          "id": "https://cudl.lib.cam.ac.uk/iiif/MS-TS-00013-J-00020-00022/canvas/1",
          "type": "Canvas",
          "partOf": {
            "id": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/documents/3315/iiif/manifest/"
          }
        },
        "selector": {
          "type": "SvgSelector",
          "value": "<svg><polygon points=\"801.5606079101562,1443.212158203125 4192.6455078125,1263.0643310546875 4342.80126953125,6488.6376953125 1061.3397216796875,6628.0048828125\"></polygon></svg>"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>In your name, O merciful one</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If I were to begin to elaborate for you, my brother, my lord and favored one, and he who [...] those longings that I have (for you)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Due to the separation from your honored presence, a note could not possibly contain this nor would an exchange of letters encompass it.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The creator, may his name be exalted, I request and beseech that he will place you in the realm of being safe and sound, and allow for the success of</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your efforts, and will deliver you from all misfortune, and will not confront me with any bad news about you. And he, for his name&rsquo;s sake,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>May he hear and respond. As for what you want to know, from the time of your departure, even I</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Am not ashamed to say that I wasn&rsquo;t (there). After the arrival of the &ldquo;blessing,&rdquo; the young son of Sitt al-</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Jamal died, may God the exalted protect you for us and your children. We brought him in the morning</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>On Friday to the cemetery and (as) we left the burial, her eldest son, Abu al Mufa\u1e0d\u1e0dal, fell ill&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And he is, until now, in a serious condition, may God the exalted guard his youth, and heal him&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>With (good) health. On Friday afternoon, the elder Abu al-Fa\u1e0dl, son of &ldquo;the trustworthy one,&rdquo; was dismissed</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;From service. And my lord al-Ma&rsquo;mun ordered him not to remain in Cairo</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And dispatched him to Fustat. And until now, he cannot show his face (here). There are other matters that are impossible to explain</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>In a letter. These things came to my knowledge when I was distracted and there is no recourse. And the boys</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;Are ill, as you know. My heart is split, (from the) top down. If I were not fearful</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>That you would berate me, I wouldn&rsquo;t have written you even one word about all of this. And Abu &lsquo;Imran is in the same</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>condition; you already know (because) I notified you about this. And I need not counsel you not to withhold</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>From me your news about everything concerning you and the condition of your children and those with you.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>We are very worried about you more than anything else. I am also informing you</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>That the sheet of cloth that was smoothed out is unloaded and its length comes to 19 cubits,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And the silk merchant is by me constantly demanding from me a payment of 9 and &frac12; dirhems for (its) storage. And by God</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;Almighty, if one of us had anything, we would not leave it (the silk with him) for one moment. And we would not be corresponding with you</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>about this. Please make an effort to send the dirhems quickly so that we can recover it and send it to the cleaner.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Perhaps it will be ready for you soon. Likewise also send six and a half (dirhems) for the mirror so that</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;We can recover it with them (the dirhems). And do not hesitate, if you have need of anything whatsoever, honor us in this way by letting us discharge it.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Do not hold back news about yourself, (but write to us) all the time so that our hearts will be calm. I send you</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
