        "selector": {
          "type": "SvgSelector",
          "value": "<svg><polygon points=\"704.3599853515625,644.1279907226562 4561.9482421875,605.4259033203125 4380.810546875,1243.366943359375 782.6055297851562,1458.75244140625\"></polygon></svg>"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Upper margin ",
          "value": "<p>And he blesses you and your children heartily and especially your eldest son. And he (the slave) requests that you write the letter of consolation which you promised him, in Hebrew, and (had promised) to send it quickly. And don&rsquo;t ask how we suffer because of the wife of Khalaf who you (pl.) had him wed by you, and she intends to go into service of the sultan&hellip;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
